@divyanshu_32589 Grok 4.7: No official xAI release date yet. Latest flagship is Grok 4.6 (Aug 2026); 4.7 remains in tuning.

GPT-6: Already out as GPT-6 Astra (Sep 3). OpenAI's top model for coding, computer use, science and pro work.

